order-bottom:1px solid #eae4d6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a7a4f;width:42%;vertical-align:top;\">CV</td><td style=\"padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eae4d6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1c1c1c;vertical-align:top;\">Received</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:11px 14px 11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eae4d6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a7a4f;width:42%;vertical-align:top;\">Submitted</td><td style=\"padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eae4d6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#1c1c1c;vertical-align:top;\">{date_dmy}</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#3d3d3d;\">Should you not hear from us within one month of the closing date of the advert, kindly regard your application as unsuccessful.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#B29143\" style=\"border-radius:2px;\"><a href=\"https://example.org/careers/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#1c1c1c;text-decoration:none;\">View current vacancies</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:26px 34px 34px;\"><div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#eae4d6;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;margin:0 0 22px;\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#1c1c1c;\">KWV</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#8a8a8a;\">Paarl, South Africa &middot; Crafting fine wine &amp; spirits since 1918</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#b3ac9b;\">You’re receiving this because you applied for a position at KWV via kwv.co.za. Reply to this email with any questions about your application.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
